246
00:14:28,379 --> 00:14:32,339
We give the idea to our young people,

247
00:14:32,339 --> 00:14:35,299
hey, what are you gonna do with your life?

248
00:14:35,299 --> 00:14:36,819
What do you wanna do with your life?

249
00:14:36,819 --> 00:14:39,219
What are you gonna, and we kind of have really

250
