267
00:15:17,779 --> 00:15:18,819
You belong to God.

268
00:15:18,819 --> 00:15:19,859
You're not your own.

269
00:15:21,059 --> 00:15:22,659
You're not your own.

270
00:15:22,659 --> 00:15:23,979
Listen, that's a good thing for us

271
00:15:23,979 --> 00:15:26,259
