278
00:15:39,019 --> 00:15:40,499
What was that price?

279
00:15:40,499 --> 00:15:43,339
It was the precious blood of Jesus.

280
00:15:43,339 --> 00:15:44,619
Amen.

281
00:15:44,619 --> 00:15:46,299
Now, I know it's a simple truth,

282
00:15:47,059 --> 00:15:47,899
but if you buy something,

283
00:15:47,899 --> 00:15:50,339
