284
00:15:50,339 --> 00:15:51,739
Amen.

285
00:15:51,739 --> 00:15:53,059
And you expect to be able to,

286
00:15:53,059 --> 00:15:54,899
sometimes people around here in America,

287
00:15:54,899 --> 00:15:56,459
they get all upset about, you know,

288
00:15:56,459 --> 00:15:58,099
this is my property, I can do what I want.

289
00:15:58,099 --> 00:15:59,979
If you live in Fairfax, you can't.

290
00:15:59,979 --> 00:16:01,859
All right, I understand that.

291
00:16:01,859 --> 00:16:03,979
