293
00:16:05,859 --> 00:16:08,059
But here in Fairfax, there's a whole lot of red tape.

294
00:16:08,059 --> 00:16:11,099
But the reality is that we recognize,

295
00:16:11,099 --> 00:16:13,139
he's bought us with his blood.

296
00:16:14,139 --> 00:16:18,059
We're bought, we're redeemed.

297
00:16:18,059 --> 00:16:23,059
And he says, therefore, glorify God in your body

298
00:16:23,659 --> 00:16:28,459
