305
00:16:48,259 --> 00:16:49,779
Submit to God.

306
00:16:49,779 --> 00:16:51,419
It's a personal decision.

307
00:16:51,419 --> 00:16:54,499
But it's also, it's a repeated decision.

308
00:16:54,499 --> 00:16:55,979
What do I mean by that?

309
00:16:55,979 --> 00:16:58,939
I could be submitted to God right now, but not in an hour.

310
00:17:01,419 --> 00:17:03,539
