00:17:17,659 --> 00:17:19,799
You have that problem with your old man sometimes, right?

318
00:17:19,799 --> 00:17:21,179
The old nature.

319
00:17:21,179 --> 00:17:23,259
Put off the old, put on the new, right?

320
00:17:23,259 --> 00:17:25,039
The old man versus the new man.

321
00:17:25,039 --> 00:17:26,799
If any man being Christ is a new creature,

322
00:17:26,799 --> 00:17:29,699
