325
00:17:33,699 --> 00:17:36,739
but it's also something that's repeated daily.

326
00:17:36,739 --> 00:17:38,019
You know, it'd be a good thing for us

327
00:17:38,019 --> 00:17:39,619
every day of our lives.

328
00:17:39,739 --> 00:17:41,779
We made those, Brianna helped me

329
00:17:41,779 --> 00:17:44,339
