332
00:17:48,619 --> 00:17:50,099
And why did we, we actually went through

333
00:17:50,099 --> 00:17:52,139
a number of different phrases that we put on there,

334
00:17:52,139 --> 00:17:54,059
and we finally settled with that one, why?

335
00:17:54,059 --> 00:17:55,939
Because I said this, listen, that's a good reminder

336
00:17:55,939 --> 00:17:59,579
