344
00:18:17,179 --> 00:18:20,719
help me to live a surrendered life.

345
00:18:20,719 --> 00:18:23,819
We sing the song, I surrender all.

346
00:18:23,819 --> 00:18:25,699
I surrender all.

347
00:18:25,699 --> 00:18:27,939
And what a great song it is.

348
00:18:27,939 --> 00:18:30,579
What a convicting song it is.

349
00:18:30,579 --> 00:18:34,099
Soul searching song, I surrender all.

350
00:18:34,099 --> 00:18:36,259
And we look at this first principle,

