368
00:19:22,619 --> 00:19:25,380
And we ask ourselves this question, how?

369
00:19:25,380 --> 00:19:28,579
See, we're not wrestling with flesh and blood.

370
00:19:28,579 --> 00:19:30,899
See, it'd be one thing for somebody to come,

371
00:19:30,899 --> 00:19:32,899
I don't know, I love playing football,

